      "role": "user",
      "content": "The fires in the hearth have long since died out, leaving nothing but gray ash and the smell of cold stone. I sit here among the rubble of what used to be my hall, staring at my hands. They’re shaking. Everything I ever fought for... the kingdom, the people, my family... it's all just dust now. There's no more glory left to find. No more quests. No more purpose. It feels like the story has just... run out of pages. It's so quiet. I'm just so tired of fighting a war that's already lost.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
